    {
      "id": "timeline-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 453,
      "width": 1185,
      "height": 84,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TIMELINE: Borg runs Google's clusters for 10+ years before any of this. Omega (Google's shared-state, optimistic-\nconcurrency scheduler experiment) is built mid-decade to fix Borg's centralized master, and its ideas get folded\nback into Borg. Kubernetes is announced in 2014; it hits v1.0 and is donated to the newly formed Cloud Native\nComputing Foundation on the same day — July 21, 2015.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TIMELINE: Borg runs Google's clusters for 10+ years before any of this. Omega (Google's shared-state, optimistic-\nconcurrency scheduler experiment) is built mid-decade to fix Borg's centralized master, and its ideas get folded\nback into Borg. Kubernetes is announced in 2014; it hits v1.0 and is donated to the newly formed Cloud Native\nComputing Foundation on the same day — July 21, 2015.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "principle-band",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 1225,
